1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,600
A toaster comes with a safety leaflet.

2
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:07,450
Its US safety standard asks for a second
off switch.

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:12,050
Find a dangerous defect? Tell the
regulator within 24 hours.

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:17,150
A frontier AI model. US federal
pre-release rules: voluntary.

5
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:22,750
California's governor vetoed a shutdown rule
in 2024. In September he ordered a study.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,550
Microsoft's president: "Right now, your washing
machine is subject to more safety rules than AI."

7
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:34,400
The toaster has a second off switch. It's
in the leaflet.
